<title>USA: Sara Hallitex ultimately to spin off units.</title>
<headline>Sara Hallitex ultimately to spin off units.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sara Hallitex Corp said Friday it expects ultimately to spin off its ProTerra Inc unit as an individually traded environmental company.</p>
<p>The company said it also plans to spin off its recently acquired Trillium Group as a publicly traded company called Trillium Communications Ltd.</p>
